                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Drew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-10T14:00:00-05:00">October 10, 1933—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>109. Department’s telegram No. 73, October 9, 3 p.m., second sentence. Exchange
                    of notes was not effected.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Drew</hi></signed></closer>
